## Guided tours (M4.7). Tours live in content/help/tours/*.yaml.

tour-start = Start tour
tour-pick = Pick a tour
tour-next = Next
tour-back = Back
tour-done = Done
tour-skip = Skip tour
tour-step = Step { $step } of { $count }
tour-refused-live = Tours can't start while the screens show something. Clear the screens or select Start practice first.
tour-simple-title = Run slides in 5 minutes
tour-simple-progress = This bar shows where you are in the service.
tour-simple-now = This is what people see on the screens now. Below it is what comes next.
tour-simple-controls = Press Space or select Next slide to show the next slide. The big buttons hide the words, hide the background or clear everything.
tour-simple-strip = These are all the slides in this song. Select one to show it.
tour-simple-clear = If something goes wrong, select Clear everything or press F12. The screens go blank at once.
tour-simple-booth = Need help? Send a note to the person in the booth.
tour-producer-title = Producer mode overview
tour-producer-order = The service order. Select an item to show it.
tour-producer-slides = The slides in the item on screen now. Press Space for the next one.
tour-producer-program = Program shows what the main screen shows now.
tour-producer-layers = Each layer can be cleared on its own: words, background, props and messages.
tour-producer-tiles = Tiles switch looks, start timers and run macros. The Stage tab sets up the stage display.
tour-producer-controls = The live controls always stay here. Nothing covers them.
tour-producer-clear = Clear everything (F12, or hold Esc) blanks every screen at once.
